{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17215","headline":"酬崔千牛四郎早秋见寄 · 权德舆","name":"酬崔千牛四郎早秋见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浩歌坐虚室，庭树生凉风。\n碧云灭奇彩，白露萎芳丛。\n感此时物变，悠然遐想通。\n偶来被簪组，自觉如池龙。\n少年才藻新，金鼎世业崇。\n凤文已彪炳，琼树何青葱。\n联镳长安道，接武承明宫。\n君登玉墀上，我侍彤庭中。\n疲病多内愧，切磋常见同。\n起予览新诗，逸韵凌秋空。\n相爱每不足，因兹寓深衷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}